WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.600
This is Kytos — an open effort to predict how cells respond to genetic perturbation.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.900
Borrowed biology kept winning — until we asked which cells we were actually predicting.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.900
Three more tries. Three honest failures.

4
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:25.300
The ceiling isn't the noise — it's the signature. So we stopped borrowing, and started learning.
